# Release artifacts (wheel AND sdist) ship only the package code (maintainer rule). This
# file only keeps setuptools' default sdist extras out; the real guard is the shared
# artifact check (brainmaze-sphinx check-dist.yml, `dist-check: error` in ci.yml and
# release.yml), which fails on any non-code file, test, demo or doc in either artifact.
prune brainmaze_eeg/tests
prune demo
prune docs_src
prune img
prune .github
